=== ARCHITECTURE (ADR-002/004/005/006/011/013/014/015) ===
  • One adaptive SwiftUI `MQTTInspectorPage` for macOS (regular) + iOS (compact/regular); no web cloning.
  • Binds through `@Observable MQTTInspectorPageModel` (P1/S8 state-holder seam); the view holds NO networking.
  • Surface defines its own pure-Swift seam (`MQTTInspectorSource` protocol + value DTOs + `MQTTInspectorProjection`)
    so it compiles WITHOUT `import Shared`; the production root wires it to the KMP `/telemetry` state holder
    (composition seam = `MQTTInspectorEmptySource`, swapped in `AppContainer.bootstrap`). Types prefixed
    `MQTTInspector*` to avoid collision with the sibling `MQTTStatusWidget`.
  • Charts: P3 `TSAreaChart` (Swift Charts) — never a WKWebView. Materials via `TSGlassPanel` (ADR-005).
  • Live freshness: `MQTTInspectorConnection` (live / stale / offline) > 2 min indicator (ADR-013).
  • i18n: every visible literal resolves from Localizable.xcstrings; web key names preserved (ADR-014).
  • a11y: accessibilityElement/Label on panels + chart; Dynamic Type; ≥44pt; light/dark (ADR-015).
  • Units: SI read from API; formatted at the display boundary (MQTTInspectorFormat), never stored non-SI.

